id/icd-10-cm</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a O98 (Matern infec/parastc dis classd elsw but compl preg/chldbrth)</li><li>Include codes from<a href="http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-icd10CM.html"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10-cm</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a O99 (Oth maternal diseases classd elsw but compl preg/chldbrth)</li><li>Include codes from<a href="http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-icd10CM.html"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10-cm</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a O9A (Maternl malig or injury compl preg/childbrth)</li><li>Include codes from<a href="http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-icd10CM.html"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10-cm</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a Z33 (Pregnant state)</li><li>Include codes from<a href="http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-icd10CM.html"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10-cm</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a Z34 (Encounter for supervision of normal pregnancy)</li><li>Include codes from<a href="http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-icd10CM.html"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10-cm</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a Z36 (Encounter for antenatal screen